      "writtenOn": "2025-11-18T18:33:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A Gralloc6 that inherits from Gralloc5 would work, yeah. I don\u0027t have a strong opinion on that vs. just having gralloc5.cpp internally do the version checks. I just don\u0027t want the entire class duplicated.\n\nI think what you have here is good enough for now, this works for me.",
